Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.04,0:00:14.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah! No...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.63,0:00:18.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.71,0:00:22.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's so cold...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.63,0:00:24.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It give me chills.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.98,0:00:34.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.20,0:00:53.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.04,0:00:58.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's the sign!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.46,0:01:05.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you warm it up?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.63,0:01:08.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The core, you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.34,0:01:09.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.51,0:01:14.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To install it, it must be inbued with a person's warmth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.81,0:01:16.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.98,0:01:19.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With the mouth– Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.13,0:01:41.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's synchronized with the core!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.09,0:01:53.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You didn't tell me this, Nee-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.52,0:02:02.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You look very cute, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.11,0:02:06.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I need to make you feel more excited too, Sylvia.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.70,0:02:19.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please! Please don't squeeze them like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.03,0:02:48.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.03,0:02:53.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to install it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.28,0:02:58.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes... Put it in, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.68,0:03:13.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sylvia?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.43,0:03:15.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.43,0:03:18.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Put it in deeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.69,0:03:28.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.57,0:03:30.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm already...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.77,0:03:33.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here we go, Sylvia.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.53,0:03:38.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I... I feel like...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.79,0:03:42.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I feel like I'm losing my mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.42,0:03:50.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.30,0:03:55.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With this... I'm an adult too.
